; DOMAIN: gross-stark [CLOSED, derived 2026-07-25]
; Claim: The Gross-Stark Conjecture is the p-adic (exceptional-zero) refinement of Rubin-Stark. For a totally real field k, a totally odd character psi, and a prime p where the p-adic L-function L_p(psi,s) has a trivial/exceptional zero at s=0, the derivative L_p'(psi,0) is conjecturally given by an L-invariant times the complex leading term: specifically the Gross-Stark formula expresses the order-of-vanishing and leading coefficient of L_p in terms of p-adic logarithms of Gross-Stark units (Brumer-Stark units) — the p-adic regulator replacing the archimedean one of Rubin-Stark. Proved by Dasgupta-Darmon-Pollack (rank 1) and Dasgupta-Kakde-Ventullo in general via Ritter-Weiss modules and the Iwasawa Main Conjecture for totally real fields (Wiles). It is the p-adic shadow of Rubin-Stark: char_Lambda(Selmer)=(L_p) descended to the Artin motive, with the exceptional zero forcing a derivative and a p-adic (rather than archimedean) regulator of the same Stark/Brumer-Stark units.
; Bridge: genesis_rubin_stark (Gross-Stark is the p-adic analogue: the archimedean regulator R_S of Rubin-Stark units is replaced by the p-adic regulator of the same units, and the exceptional zero of L_p forces the order-r derivative to match) + genesis_iwasawa_main_conjecture (the Gross-Stark formula is proved by descending char_Lambda(X_infty)=(L_p) for totally real fields to the Artin motive, the exceptional zero arising from the trivial zero of the p-adic L-function) + genesis_euler_system (the Brumer-Stark/Gross-Stark units are norm-compatible special units whose Euler-system properties feed the Ritter-Weiss/Kolyvagin machinery bounding the relevant class groups).
(= (p-adic-l-function $psi) (kubota-leopoldt-p-adic $psi))
(= (exceptional-zero $psi $p) (trivial-zero (p-adic-l-function $psi) 0))
(= (gross-stark-unit $K $S) (brumer-stark-unit (s-units $K $S)))
(= (p-adic-regulator $S) (exterior-regulator (gross-stark-unit) (p-adic-log)))
(= (gross-stark) (equal (nth-derivative (p-adic-l-function $psi) (order (exceptional-zero $psi $p)) 0) (p-adic-regulator $S)))
(= (p-adic-refine (rubin-stark) (iwasawa-descent)) (gross-stark))
(= (specialize (iwasawa-main-conjecture) (totally-real-artin)) (gross-stark))